() Tj
T*
(Evidence-first design) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Every visual pattern should answer: "What supports this claim?" Capability cards, ) Tj
T*
(recommendations, and passport claims must show evidence count, confidence, provenance, and ) Tj
T*
(explanation access. Evidence is not hidden in footnotes; it is a first-class UI layer.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Enterprise appearance) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Syrka must be credible in boardrooms, ministries, universities, and employer procurement ) Tj
T*
(processes. The visual language should use disciplined typography, restrained color, strong ) Tj
T*
(alignment, consistent spacing, and official-document quality.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Calm interfaces) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Capability inference affects identity and opportunity. The product must not feel like a social ) Tj
T*
(feed, casino, or consumer growth app. Use quiet transitions, neutral backgrounds, deliberate ) Tj
T*
(status colors, and clear review paths.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Typography and whitespace) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Typography carries institutional trust. Whitespace creates room for reasoning. Dashboards should) Tj
T*
( not be crowded; they should guide scanning from summary to evidence to action.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Trustworthy AI) Tj
T*
